# Build context for the PocketBase image (backend/pocketbase/Dockerfile).
#
# This context is deliberately tiny — the image downloads its own pinned binary,
# so nothing in here is needed except docker-entrypoint.sh. The exclusions below
# exist because this directory is also the local install location, and a local
# install accumulates things that must never reach an image.

# The live database: collections, users, api_keys rows, otp_codes, messages, and
# the Fernet-encrypted Meta token. If this were in the build context it would be
# copied into an image layer, where deleting it later would not remove it. That
# is the operator's own data and it stays on the operator's volume.
pb_data/
pb_data*/

# The PocketBase server binary, for the same reason as .gitignore: ~40 MB,
# platform-specific, and downloaded fresh inside the image with a checksum check.
pocketbase

# Local backups and exports
*.zip
*.tar.gz
backups/

# Secrets — PocketBase is configured entirely from the environment.
.env
.env*

# Editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
